  "worked_solution": "The given sentence is the negation of the following sentence: \n\n$9$ is both even and prime,  \n\nwhich can be expressed symbolically as $P∧Q.$\n\nThe negation is represented by the symbol \"$¬$\". \n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as $¬(P∧Q).$",
